[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0297","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0297.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0693","title":"WebTrends WebTrends HTTP Server 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"WebTrends Enterprise Reporting Server 3.1c 和 3.5 版本的HTTP服务器存在源代码泄露漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在目标URL的文件名后添加URL编码的空格字符（%20），绕过服务器对脚本文件的保护机制，导致服务器以源代码形式而非正常执行后的结果返回脚本文件内容。攻击者借此可直接获取服务器上脚本的敏感信息，包括数据库连接凭据、业务逻辑代码和内部文件路径等机密数据。该漏洞影响 WebTrends Enterprise Reporting Server 3.1c 和 3.5 版本，攻击面覆盖所有将相关服务暴露在网络中的实例。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0693"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46.967","remediation":"建议立即将受影响服务器升级至 WebTrends Enterprise Reporting Server 更高版本，3.1c 和 3.5 均受影响且官方已发布安全修复。如无法立即升级，可在 WebTrends HTTP Server 的配置中对包含 URL 编码空格（%20）的 CGI 请求返回 403 Forbidden 错误以阻止源文件泄露。同时建议在防火墙或反向代理层对所有 CGI 脚本的请求统一过滤 %20 等控制字符，防止攻击者通过构造含编码空格的 URL 读取脚本源代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99166905208903&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2812","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6639","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20895","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10542eebf1e993745def113b14941719ae818f2d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0693.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0693","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0693.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc4d86fa626798689c9cd6668d1881354e44e4cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0693.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6jw9-8f44-h84j/GHSA-6jw9-8f44-h84j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0693.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-41.txt","https://github.com/ws-researcher/CAEA/blob/098ddb07c83845feda3d1b1d56ef634927954af4/KGA/dataSet/ICNS/entN_ids_1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0295","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0690","title":"University of Cambridge Exim 3.x 邮件传输代理格式字符串漏洞","description":"Exim 3.x 邮件传输代理（MTA）在批量 SMTP 模式（-bS）下存在格式字符串漏洞。该漏洞源于 Exim 在处理邮件头部的域名字符串时未正确过滤格式字符串控制符，当管理员启用了语法检查（syntax checking）模式后，远程攻击者可以通过向 From 邮件头中注入格式字符串（如 %p），触发栈上内存信息泄露并进一步覆盖栈帧执行任意代码，最终以 root 权限完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响多种 Linux 发行版所打包的 Exim 3.x 版本，包括 Red Hat 3.22-10、Debian 3.12 及 Conectiva 3.16，利用门槛极低——仅需通过 SMTP 协议发送一封包含特制头部的邮件即可触发，无需身份认证。ExploitDB（EDB-ID: 20900）已公开可利用的本地提权利用代码，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0690"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46.620","remediation":"升级 Exim 至修复版本：Debian 系统升级至 exim 3.12-10.1（DSA-058），Red Hat 系统应用 RHSA-2001-078 安全补丁，Conectiva 系统安装公告 000402 对应更新包。若无法立即升级，可在 exim 配置文件中禁用语法检查模式（syntax checking）及批处理 SMTP 模式（-bS），避免攻击者利用格式字符串漏洞执行任意代码；同时建议限制本地用户对 /usr/sbin/exim 二进制文件的访问权限，仅允许必要的的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0041.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000402","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-058","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-078.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2828","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6671","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20900","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0690.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4a89b44478cf1ae516da29bd6f16b00a8bec011/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0690.json","https://github.com/x0rz/EQGRP/blob/0c2354ff1073099b2aa417030b3167ec29d7279c/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d2521a6a6a6b95fdd6c2651e419302899bbee89/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0690.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-058.nasl","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0690.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/99cae226d61b8e74336dc0c5e362f6c067c34ab5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmjp-jcfp-7jf8/GHSA-wmjp-jcfp-7jf8.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-058.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/divining-risk/blob/286d414a20238d70344afbbc3869527af7cea8e5/data/VulnCheck-KEV.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0293","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0688","title":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 3.0/4.0/4.7/5.x（最高至5.9.5.0版本）的CWD（Change Working Directory）命令处理模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞的原理是FTP服务器在解析CWD或CD命令参数时未对输入进行充分验证，当接收到包含无效\". .\"（点-空格-点）序列的目录路径参数时，会导致缓冲区溢出并触发TSFTPSRV服务进程的访问违规，从而使FTP服务崩溃并中断运行。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本Broker FTP Server的Windows系统，覆盖3.0至5.9.5.0之间的所有版本。攻击条件为攻击者能够在网络层面访问目标FTP服务的21端口，且无需任何身份验证凭据即可发起攻击。利用方式为远程攻击者通过FTP客户端连接到目标服务器后，重复发送参数为\". .\"的CWD或CD命令，持续触发缓冲区溢出，最终导致FTP服务进程崩溃停止响应，必须手动重启服务才能恢复，从而造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞的相关利用代码已在2001年6月通过Bugtraq邮件列表公开，安全研究人员认为缓冲区溢出存在被进一步利用以获取服务器控制权的潜在可能性。TransSoft已发布更新版本修复此问题，管理员应及时升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0688"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46.400","remediation":"立即升级 TransSoft Broker FTP Server 至修正了 CWD 缓冲区溢出的修复版本。如无法短期完成升级，应在防火墙中限制 FTP 服务（TCP 21 端口）仅对可信来源开放，关闭匿名登录功能，并在 FTP 服务层面限制单 IP 的连接频率与异常 CWD 命令请求，以防止服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190032","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2851","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20910","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cec5b6a05e11425484ae88e202806353cc4620e6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0688.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0688","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0688.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f5111fc7f0351eb7acd97d5a87fa56872d8a50fd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0688.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/905c759ea25c11a59e5c85d4af57ced286cebb3a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wpp7-4crq-f956/GHSA-wpp7-4crq-f956.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0688.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e626203d-3dd4-483e-adea-41b84c0bae44.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0293.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0292","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0685","title":"Thibault Godouet FCron 1 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"FCron 在 1.1.1 版本之前存在符号链接漏洞，其 fcrontab 命令在处理临时文件时未对临时文件路径进行安全检查。具有本地账户的攻击者可在系统临时目录中预先创建指向其他用户 crontab 文件的符号链接，当该用户执行 fcrontab 编辑操作时， FCron 会错误地将调度配置写入符号链接所指向的其他用户的 crontab 文件中，从而导致其他用户的计划任务配置被篡改或破坏，可实现跨用户的权限提升或服务中断。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0685"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46.060","remediation":"升级 FCron 至 1.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复临时文件符号链接漏洞，引入安全的临时文件创建机制防止被攻击者利用。如暂无法立即升级，可将 fcron 临时文件目录（/var/spool/fcron/）权限设置为仅 fcron 用户可读写，并确保普通用户无法创建指向该目录的符号链接作为临时缓解措施。建议同时检查并恢复可能已遭篡改的用户 crontab 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://fcron.free.fr/CHANGES.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98339581702282&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2835","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7127","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20905","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0685.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0685.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0685","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0685.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0685.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c8mr-fhvj-www3/GHSA-c8mr-fhvj-www3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e95b7758-5b7d-4b8d-874b-4987a6b59327.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0685.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0287","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0287.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0675","title":"Rit Research Labs The Bat! 1.51 邮件客户端 CR/LF 处理拒绝服务漏洞 (CVE-2001-0675)","description":"Rit Research Labs The Bat! 1.51 邮件客户端在处理邮件内容时，未正确处理仅包含回车符 <CR> 而缺少换行符 <LF> 的畸形邮件，导致远程攻击者可通过发送包含单独回车符的特制邮件触发拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞影响 Rit Research Labs The Bat! 1.51 for Windows 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发送恶意邮件触发漏洞，导致邮件客户端拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P)，属于中危级别拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者仅需向目标用户发送包含畸格式行结束符的邮件即可触发拒绝服务，导致邮件客户端崩溃或无法正常处理邮件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0675"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:43.843","remediation":"升级到 The Bat! 4.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了邮件解析的 CR/LF 处理漏洞。或者，从官方网站 https://thebat.net 手动下载并安装 4.0 版。在安装前，可暂时在邮件服务器或客户端策略中禁用不支持 CR/LF 不完整序列的 MIME 解码，或者配置电子邮件服务只接受确以 LF 结尾的邮件。对于 Windows 2000/XP 系统，建议启用安全更新并应用最新的杀毒软件签名数据库以增强保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0345.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0381.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0410.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2636","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6423","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20783","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0675.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0675","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0675.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0675.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2r4r-h566-5q6r/GHSA-2r4r-h566-5q6r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3e15eb83-e210-4d27-ac1c-51144e2bd783.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0675.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0287.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0287.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0287.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0281","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0281.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0653","title":"Sendmail debugger 命令行参数本地缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.10.0 至 8.11.5 以及 8.12.0 beta 版本的调试功能存在输入验证错误。由于 tTflag() 函数使用有符号整数处理带 `-d` 开关的调试参数中的 category 部分，本地攻击者可提供过大的数值触发有符号整数溢出，使其被解释为负数，该值作为 trace vector 的索引可用于在进程内存范围内进行写入操作从而修改进程内存，并可能获取提升的权限。由于 `-d` 命令行参数在程序丢弃提升权限之前处理，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞实现完整的系统沦陷，目前已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0653"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:41.970","remediation":"将 Sendmail 8.10.0 至 8.11.5 及 8.12.0 beta 升级至官方修复版本。如使用 8.11 分支，请升级到 Sendmail 8.11.6；如使用 8.12 分支，请升级到 Sendmail 8.12.1 或更高稳定版。可通过 ftp.sendmail.org 下载对应源码包重新编译安装，或使用系统包管理器（如 yum、apt、FreeBSD ports）更新 sendmail 软件包并重启服务。若暂时无法完成升级，可在 /etc/mail/sendmail.mc 中注释禁用 debugger (-d) 命令行选项的相关配置，重新生成 sendmail.cf 并重启服务，以此限制本地用户使用调试功能，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000412","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-032-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99841063100516&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-106.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-032.0.txt","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-133.shtml","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-075.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_028_sendmail_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3163","http://www.sendmail.org/8.11.html","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBTL0112-007","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7016","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21063","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4b54eaec6e1ac2fa73932c72cc91a932e04af217/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0653","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/4f7816d4f96b3630e6f199beccb961d16e16b19c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0653.md","https://github.com/tomhart-msc/verisec/blob/02f3a9660885181705e7550b8609534bbbaa414c/programs/apps/sendmail/CVE-2001-0653/README","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2a511a3a50683ea9152c5bacd8a2a2e417f6e16/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0653.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32f28e88cd643e53b067fd929c3f6aaf649f3db6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pw59-xvgj-36g7/GHSA-pw59-xvgj-36g7.json","https://github.com/westtide/open-source-case-studies/blob/57e71842cdb3e034316b0d083f8d19f680501b67/verisec/.frama-c/programs_apps_sendmail_CVE-2001-0653_complete_tTflag_ok.eva/warnings.log","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/8608e2acfa2206042eff8a455c82e251a64c277c/packages/cve_diff/data/cves/ALL_OPENSOURCE_CVES_COMPLETE_HISTORICAL.csv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0653.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/sendmail_local_overflow.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0281.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0278","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0278.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0649","title":"Apple Personal Web Sharing 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apple Personal Web Sharing 1.1/1.5/1.5.5 版本存在远程拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过发送超长的 HTTP 请求导致服务拒绝。该漏洞源于 Web 共享服务对超长 HTTP 请求处理不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可发送特制的超长 HTTP 请求触发漏洞，导致服务崩溃或无响应，造成拒绝服务。影响 Apple Personal Web Sharing 1.1、1.5 及 1.5.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向目标服务发送精心构造的超长 HTTP 请求即可触发拒绝服务，无需身份验证。Apple 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至修复版本。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC（EDB-ID: 20844），攻击者可直接利用该 PoC 进行攻击验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0649"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:41.640","remediation":"立即升级 Apple Personal Web Sharing 到最新支持的版本（如 2.0 或更高），并停用此服务如果不再需要。如果无法立即升级，可通过修改 httpd.conf 配置文件将 KeepAliveOff 设为 on，并限制 MaxRequestSize 设置为 8192 或更小，以限制 HTTP 请求长度，防止长请求导致服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/184548","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6536","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20844","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0649.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0649","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0649.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0649.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gpqf-2gcw-mwj8/GHSA-gpqf-2gcw-mwj8.json","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/pre2008/PWS_DoS.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0649.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--aa3f9d0b-85ce-4610-b849-296716ead45e.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0278.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0278.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0272","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0643","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 CLSID 文件执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 存在 CLSID 文件执行漏洞，该漏洞源于 IE 5.5 在文件名末尾包含类标识符 (CLSID) 时不会显示该 CLSID，导致攻击者可通过构造包含 CLSID 的文件名（如 document.txt{CLSID}），将可执行程序伪装成安全的文档文件类型，诱导用户点击执行恶意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 版本，攻击者需诱导用户点击恶意链接或打开恶意文件，利用方式为社工欺骗用户执行伪装成安全文档的恶意程序，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响完整性，Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0643"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:40.963","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Internet Explorer 5.5，升级至 Microsoft Edge、Google Chrome 或 Mozilla Firefox 等现代受支持浏览器。如必须使用 IE，请升级至 IE 11 并安装最新累积安全更新（KB4598298 等）。临时缓解措施：在文件夹选项中取消勾选\"隐藏已知文件类型的扩展名\"，在 Internet 选项-安全-自定义级别中禁用\"未标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件\"和\"对未标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件提示\"，并通过组策略或注册表禁用 CLSID 扩展隐藏功能（HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\CLSID\\{...} 相关键值）。同时加强用户安全意识教育，不打开来历不明的文件附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://vil.nai.com/vil/virusSummary.asp?virus_k=99048","http://www.guninski.com/clsidext.html","http://www.osvdb.org/7858","http://www.sarc.com/avcenter/venc/data/vbs.postcard%40mm.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/176909","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2612","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6426","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0643.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0643","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0643.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0643.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c2hj-4gfw-x63q/GHSA-c2hj-4gfw-x63q.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0643.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a372b591-b535-4cdc-92f0-8ed3fcd56bfd.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/CWE-Expert/blob/f634e911e6c24a1ad8b9619383e2ab3eb2d9ebd4/CWE_corpus/markdown/4_cwe_trimmed_top25.md.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b12a3924bcdfa7af53ab2da329173ee04bf863bc/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0270","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0641","title":"Linux man 程序 -S 选项堆溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 man 程序在处理 -S 选项参数时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当本地用户向 man 命令传递超长的 -S 选项参数时，可触发缓冲区溢出，进而以 man 用户组权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Immunix OS 6.2/7.0、RedHat 5.2/6.2/7.0、S.u.S.E 6.x/7.0/7.1 等多个 Linux 发行版。攻击者需在目标系统上具有本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞，成功利用后可获得与 man 用户组等价的操作权限，可能导致敏感文件被读取或系统被进一步控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0641"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:40.733","remediation":"立即安装各发行版安全更新：RedHat Linux 5.2/6.2 升级 man 包至 1.5i-0.5x.1/0.6x.1，RedHat 7.0 升级至 1.5i-4，SuSE Linux 6.x/7.0/7.1 及 Immunix OS 6.2/7.0 应用对应厂商安全补丁，执行 rpm -Fvh man*.rpm（RHEL）或 rpm -Uvh man*.rpm（SuSE/Immunix）。如无法立即升级，可临时以 root 执行 chmod -s /usr/bin/man 移除 man 程序的 setgid 位作为缓解措施，或通过 /etc/sudoers 限制普通用户执行 man 程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0087.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_019_man_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-069.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190136","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2711","https://e