:"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0552"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.043","remediation":"建议立即升级 HP OpenView NNM 至 6.1 以上补丁版本，或升级 Tivoli NetView 至 7.x 版本。如无法升级，可停止 ovactiond 服务（`kill -9 <PID>` 或从启动脚本中移除），并在防火墙上限制 SNMP 161/162 端口仅允许可信源 IP 访问，同时过滤 SNMP trap 消息中的 shell 元字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99201278704545&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-24.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952171","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2845","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20909","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0552.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0552","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0552.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0552.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5965518125739d48e98f0cf3efbf7359253ff7cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58wf-w6hc-fcfx/GHSA-58wf-w6hc-fcfx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0552.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--903d30cb-433d-4fc7-aa59-22236e528b99.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2845/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0216.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0202","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0507","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 In-Process Table 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 在处理进程内系统文件查找时使用相对路径，导致本地权限提升漏洞。攻击者可在受影响系统上放置特洛伊木马文件，当 IIS 加载进程内组件时，由于路径解析机制缺陷，系统会优先加载攻击者放置的恶意文件而非原始系统文件，从而以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 上运行的 IIS 5.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS01-044 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0507"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:26.223","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-044 提供的累积补丁 (Q301625)，或升级至 Windows Server 2003 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 IIS 管理器中禁用不必要的 ISAPI 扩展和应用程序映射，限制本地用户对系统目录的写入权限，并确保 %windir%\\system32 等关键目录仅允许 Administrators 完全控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/205069","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-132.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/5607","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-044","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6985","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A909","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A912","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21072","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0507.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0507.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0507","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0507.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/b