:"AVE-2001-0274","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0646","title":"Maxum Development Rumpus FTP Server 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Maxum Rumpus FTP Server 1.3.2/1.3.3/1.3.4/2.0.3 开发版本存在目录名处理缺陷导致的远程拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的畸形目录名请求，触发服务端异常导致 FTP 服务崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Rumpus FTP Server 多个早期版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，利用方式为发送精心构造的目录名命令导致服务器进程崩溃拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0646"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20","updated":"2001-09-20","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Maxum Rumpus FTP Server 2.0.4 或更高版本（官方已发布修复版本）。若无法升级，建议立即停用该 FTP 服务并迁移至现代维护中的 FTP 服务器（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD 或 FileZilla Server），或在防火墙层面限制仅信任 IP 访问 21 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20845","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0646.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0646","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0646.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0646.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3fr2-x8c2-c8pr/GHSA-3fr2-x8c2-c8pr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fda68432-46c3-4e36-95ef-c8a5fe063adf.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0646.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0274.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0357","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1013","title":"Red Hat Linux 7.0 Apache 用户名枚举漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-1013是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1013"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:24.740","remediation":"禁用 Apache 的 UserDir 指令（在 httpd.conf 中添加 UserDir disabled），或配置自定义错误页面统一返回 404 状态码以消除用户名枚举信息泄露。Red Hat Linux 7.0 用户应升级至 Red Hat 官方发布的最新安全更新补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q3/0083.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q3/0087.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q3/0094.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/213667","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3335","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7129","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21112","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b07067ca91b3ffc85e0e1474c6067f8e36d784cf/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1013.json","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/999670cb6a939b6c93840ce666941756e4c5dcf5/program/plugins/nikto_apacheusers.plugin","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1013","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1570a9083baeda671ee63edb768a5f78a73607df/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1013.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/440b4085dc6f68870cd0bf207bbc8dd57d0fd487/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1013.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2001-1013-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/APACHE/MSF/UserdirEnum_infos.txt","https://github.com/chroblert/AssetManage/blob/1024c864fe3e0e1b5715ce742476dd2d1b2a67ae/Util/nmap-7.80/scripts/http-userdir-enum.nse","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_username.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0357.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0357.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0355","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1009","title":"Fetchmail IMAP/POP3 LIST 响应负索引任意内存覆盖权限提升漏洞","description":"Fetchmail（含 fetchmail-ssl）5.8.17 之前版本在处理 IMAP 或 POP/POP3 服务器对 LIST 请求的响应时，未正确校验带符号整数索引，远程恶意邮件服务器可返回负索引值触发任意内存覆盖，进而可能导致权限提升或代码执行。攻击条件为客户端主动连接并信任恶意或被劫持的 IMAP/POP3 服务；影响使用受影响版本 Fetchmail 拉取邮件的用户与系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1009"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:24.243","remediation":"立即升级 fetchmail 至 5.8.17 或更高版本，该版本修复了 POP3/IMAP 响应中Signed整数索引漏洞，阻止远程恶意服务器通过 LIST 请求覆写任意内存并提升权限。若无法立即升级，可在 fetchmail 配置中禁用 POP3/IMAP 协议（仅使用支持的协议），或将 fetchmail 运行在低权限账户下，通过 Linux 能力集（capabilities）或 seccomp 限制其内存访问权限，降低被利用后的影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-08/0118.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000419","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-071","http://www.iss.net/